L44: A statistically significant difference was observed between RVEDVI means difference values in male and RVEDVI means difference values in female ( P  = 0.001), as shown in Table  5 . Table 5 Comparison between increment of CMR values among sex (only studies with both male and female data were shown separately). Dimension P  value RVEDVI 0.001 RVESVI 0.175 EF % 0.423 MASS index 0.28
